eight: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于养豆与冲煮\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 向阳农场\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          向阳莊園位于洛哈省冈萨纳镇（厄瓜多尔），海拔1750米，咖啡种植面积2公顷。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          该地区因温暖的热带气候脱颖而出，全年气温变化在 16 至 25 摄氏度之间。农场种植的咖啡品种是改良鉄皮卡品种。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          咖啡果的采收和手选是由该社区的妇女劳动力完成，她们在咖啡果成熟的高峰期进行采收，然后在袋子里里进行 72 小时的有氧发酵；随后，咖啡果有遮荫\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          的晒床上晾晒干燥，直至含水率达到目标后收储静置起来；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaIxpIwDDdFs8DZI1XR9yHib46icRtWNPAW47xsGLyGYsXibUUCmZCGXGzg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          这个小型家庭项目的目标在于环境的可持续性以及社会影响力。农场着重推动女性就业，这便是为何咖啡生产所涉及的所有流程均由该地区的女性来执行，以助力并推动社区的发展。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaLdRH7KvsI6gQicDNYxImM7YdPru2ibfqQES3xMKu45yjJzpGwqfPPOKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          通过购买每一袋 Finca Los Girasoles 咖啡，您不但能够获得令人惊叹的咖啡品质，还能借由可持续农业实践产生有意识的影响，并推动农业经济发展。正如农场主所说，我们所做的每一件事，都饱含爱意，以激发我们每个人最优秀的一面。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlad1UxDWN2R5DZ6n9mibvhmBbJwQECmrrWbodkGcWp7uicTScicMVN0GNicw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlapzt2CtONibZMbA6MjP6xdOoqf0We5ibI2THJDiaPgbgUCogRMQjic7X4xA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          同样处理方式的批次获得了2023年厄瓜多尔金杯赛的第八名\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;backgr